menu "Built-in components"
    config PICO_COMPONENT_API_ORIGIN
        string "HTTPS platform origin for built-in components (no trailing slash)"
        default "https://mogo.mantake.shop"
        help
            Weather uses only the platform proxy. Never configure a provider
            endpoint or put provider credentials in firmware. Public activation
            requires a configured platform and confirmed attribution/license.
endmenu

# 触摸阈值与丢点诊断；诊断日志仅在排查构建启用。
# Touch threshold and tap-drop diagnostics; enable diagnostic logging only for investigations.
menu "Touch diagnostics"

    config TOUCH_FT6336U_UPGRADE_ON_BOOT
        bool "Upgrade the LT0470GF0430M_V1.1 FT6336U controller to V04 on boot"
        depends on IDF_TARGET_ESP32S31
        default n
        help
            仅用于 Metalio E-INK4 Plus 的 LT0470GF0430M_V1.1、684x1216
            FT6336U 模组。初始化时独占总线，向独立触控芯片写入供应商V04。
            已为V04或更高版本时跳过；唤醒不刷写。失败最多完整重试一次。
            这是持久触控固件升级，回退ESP应用不会回退触控芯片；保持供电。
            产品配置开启升级并使用THRESHOLD_PERCENT=100，不叠加旧75%调校。
            Only for the named 684x1216 panel on Metalio E-INK4 Plus.
            Exclusively updates the separate touch controller during init.
            V04 and newer are retained; wake never updates. Retry at most once.
            Keep power connected. Reverting the ESP app does not revert the
            controller. Product defaults enable updates with a 100% threshold.

    config TOUCH_FT6336U_THRESHOLD_PERCENT
        int "Experimental FT6336U touch threshold (% of module reset value)"
        depends on IDF_TARGET_ESP32S31
        range 50 100
        default 100
        help
            100 保留模组阈值，不新增寄存器访问。75/50 将正常模式 0x80
            检测阈值降至复位实际值的 75%/50%（向上取整，不写零）。
            初始化和唤醒时重新应用，写后校验，失败恢复原值。
            这是整颗触摸芯片的实验调校，不保证单独作用于盖板三键；
            产品配置采用100%保留原阈值。不同膜厚、屏幕误触
            及充电噪声仍需在对应样机验证。
            本阈值选项不进入工厂/校准/升级模式，不写 0xA9 量产测试阈值；
            独立的UPGRADE_ON_BOOT开关才控制持久固件升级。
            100 preserves the module default without extra register access.
            75/50 scales normal-mode register 0x80 to 75%/50% of its reset
            value, rounded up and never zero. Apply after init/wake resets,
            verify readback and restore the original on failure. This is an
            experimental chip-wide setting, not a proven cover-key-only
            control. Product defaults select 100% to preserve the
            original. Validate each glass, screen false touches and charger
            noise on hardware. This threshold option performs no factory,
            calibration, upgrade or production-test threshold (0xA9) writes;
            UPGRADE_ON_BOOT independently controls persistent firmware updates.

    config TOUCH_DIAG
        bool "Enable touch tap-drop diagnostics logging"
        default n
        help
            阅读翻页偶发无响应排查用：在触摸输入链路（app_loop / ui_gesture /
            app_book / cst836u）输出单行事件日志、阻塞窗口与统计汇总。
            Investigation aid for sporadic dropped page-turn taps: one-line
            event logs, stall windows and stats on the touch input chain.

    config TOUCH_DIAG_BEEP
        bool "Beep when an input event is discarded without action"
        depends on TOUCH_DIAG
        default n
        help
            手势被取消或双击挂起被冲销时短鸣一声，便于不接串口时统计丢失率。
            Short beep when a gesture is cancelled or a pending double-tap is
            dropped, so drop rates can be counted without a serial console.

endmenu

# bring-up 阶段的面板自检；正式固件保持关闭。
# Panel self-test for bring-up; keep disabled in production images.
menu "Bring-up diagnostics"

    config APP_NETWORK_CONNECT_TRACE
        bool "Log resolved server addresses and TCP/TLS connection progress"
        depends on LOG_DYNAMIC_LEVEL_CONTROL
        default n
        help
            仅用于本地排查间歇连接失败：启用 esp-tls 的 DEBUG 日志，
            在 socket 关闭前记录实际解析地址和连接阶段；不启用 HTTP
            请求头、响应正文或 mbedTLS 密钥调试。正式固件保持关闭。
            Enable esp-tls DEBUG logs for local connection investigations.
            Record resolved addresses before failed sockets are closed, without
            enabling HTTP headers, response bodies or mbedTLS key debugging.

    config APP_LOCK_SLEEP_TRACE
        bool "Retain lock, sleep and clock-refresh stages across resets"
        default n
        help
            在 RTC 内存记录锁屏、浅睡和时钟推屏阶段，重启后保留第一次复位原因。
            启动及 10/30/60 秒重放现场，便于 USB 重连读取；不写 NVS 或 TF，
            不增加唤醒、不关闭看门狗，不改变供电和睡眠策略。
            Keep reset breadcrumbs in RTC RAM and replay after boot and at
            10/30/60 seconds. No storage writes, extra wakeups or policy changes.

    config APP_SLEEP_DIAGNOSTICS
        bool "Save one light-sleep summary after wake and replay at boot"
        default n
        help
            浅睡会话只在 RAM 累计调用时间、失败和唤醒原因；退出并恢复外设后
            仅保存一次到 NVS sleep_diag/last，下次启动重放以便 USB 重连读取。
            不新增唤醒或逐切片日志。时间统计不是电流测量，保存失败不阻断唤醒。
            Accumulate call times, failures and wake causes in RAM; after leaving
            sleep and restoring peripherals, save once to NVS sleep_diag/last
            and replay at boot for USB reconnection. No extra wakeups or per-slice
            logs. Timings are not current measurements; save errors never block wake.

    config DISPLAY_POWER_DIAG
        bool "Log panel power requests and idle deadlines"
        default n
        help
            排查供电就绪超时和前光下边缘变灰：记录开关电请求、保持时间、
            主循环关电检查延迟，仅在供电失败后额外读取现有状态寄存器。
            Investigate power-ready timeouts and lit edge graying: log power
            requests, hold durations and idle-check lateness, reading extra
            existing status registers only after a power failure.

    config READER_PERF
        bool "Measure reader operation latency and memory"
        default n
        help
            输出阅读操作、阶段耗时、字体缓存及操作内存低水位，供固定场景对比。
            Emit reader operation/stage timing, font cache counters and local
            heap lows for comparisons under fixed conditions.

    config READER_MEMORY
        bool "Record reader resource ownership snapshots"
        depends on READER_PERF
        default n
        help
            在计时结束后遍历各拥有者的存活资源，并记录关闭和退出快照。
            仅用于资源诊断；固定页序的性能对照应关闭，避免遍历影响后续缓存。
            Walk live owner allocations after timing and record close/exit snapshots.
            Enable only for resource diagnostics; disable for fixed-page timing
            comparisons so resource walks do not affect subsequent caches.

    config MOGO_EPD_TEST_PATTERN
        bool "Run EPD test pattern at boot"
        default n
        help
            开机先画灰阶条、棋盘格、细线、四角十字、中心圆和 1 px 边框，
            再做一次 GC16 全刷与 20 次 GL16 局刷，最后停 10 秒。
            Draw gray bars, checkerboard, thin lines, corner crosses, a center
            circle and a 1 px border, then one GC16 full refresh and 20 GL16
            area updates, holding the pattern for 10 seconds.

endmenu

# 联网升级源；保持默认即沿用正式站点，填自建前缀即可接入自己的 OTA 平台。
# Online update source; keep the default public site, or point at a self-hosted platform.
menu "Online update (OTA)"

    config PICO_OTA_FEED_URL
        string "Manifest URL"
        default "https://mogo.mantake.shop/api/v2/ota/devices/mogo-e4p/update.json"
        help
            设备读取的唯一 JSON 清单地址。必须是 HTTPS，服务器不得重定向，
            响应体不超过 8 KB。
            The only manifest URL. Must be HTTPS, the server must not redirect,
            and the body must stay under 8 KB.

    config PICO_OTA_EXTRA_ORIGIN
        string "Extra download origin prefix (empty disables)"
        default ""
        help
            允许清单引用的额外下载前缀，必须以斜杠结尾，例如
            https://ota.example.com/files/。前缀之后只允许一个 .bin 文件名，
            不允许查询串或子目录，避免清单把设备引到任意地址。
            Extra download prefix a manifest may reference; must end with a
            slash, e.g. https://ota.example.com/files/. Only one .bin filename
            may follow it, with no query string or subdirectories.

    config PICO_OTA_ALLOW_HTTP
        bool "Allow plain http:// origins (local OTA testing only)"
        default n
        help
            仅用于本地联调：允许清单与下载前缀使用 http://。仍然只接受上面
            配置过的前缀，不会放开任意地址。正式发布必须关闭。
            Local OTA testing only: permits plain http:// origins. Only the
            configured prefixes above are accepted; arbitrary URLs remain
            rejected. Must stay off for production releases.

endmenu
